cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Price-Prophet in your research, please cite it as follows."
type: software
title: "Price-Prophet: ML-powered dynamic pricing engine"
abstract: >
  Price-Prophet is a production-ready FastAPI service that predicts optimal
  product prices using a VotingRegressor ensemble of XGBoost, LightGBM, and
  RandomForest. It features FAISS-based semantic retrieval, KS-test and PSI
  drift monitoring, and an Apache Airflow DAG for automated retraining.
authors:
